          loading="lazy" 
        />
      </div>

      <!-- SECTION 3 -->
      <section class="section" id="core-ingredients">
        <h2>Core Ingredients Used in Liquid Detergent Formulation</h2>
        <p>
          The selection of raw materials in modern liquid detergents is strictly dictated by targeted chemical functionality and absolute system compatibility. A successful formulator must ensure that every component remains fully soluble, chemically active, and thermodynamically stable across the product's entire intended pH range and thermal storage window. Furthermore, these ingredients must not competitively interact to neutralize each other's efficacy.
        </p>
        <p>
          The core surfactant network establishes the foundational structural backbone and primary cleaning power of the formulation. To maximize this efficacy, builders, hydrotropic solvents, and specialized functional additives are precisely incorporated to modify the surrounding chemical environment and maintain pristine fluid stability:
        </p>
        <ul style="padding-left: 20px;">
          <li><strong>Anionic Surfactants</strong>: (e.g., LABSA, SLES) Provide the heavy-duty primary soil removal power via aggressive electrostatic interactions and robust foam generation.</li>
          <li><strong>Nonionic Surfactants</strong>: (e.g., Fatty Alcohol Ethoxylates) Excel at penetrating tough particulate grease and maintain their detergency across extreme temperature fluctuations without being deactivated by hard water.</li>
          <li><strong>Amphoteric Surfactants</strong>: (e.g., CAPB) Exhibit zwitterionic behavior, buffering the harshness of anionics to dramatically improve skin mildness and enhance overall foam structural stability.</li>
          <li><strong>Chelating Builders</strong>: Aggressively bind with destructive Calcium and Magnesium hard water ions, preventing them from precipitating and deactivating the primary surfactant molecules.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Image: Mixing Tank -->
      <div class="image-slot">
        <img 
          src="https://assets.zyrosite.com/AGBzPMBJDQiwDGny/liquid-detergent-manufacturing-mixing-tank-1NP5JgpbIjj2KFZ6.png" 
